      "values": {
        "Title": "S\u1EAFp x\u1EBFp m\u1ED9t g\u00F3c h\u1ECDc t\u1EADp nh\u1ECF",
        "Level": "beginner",
        "ContentType": "articles",
        "Topic": "H\u1ECDc t\u1EADp",
        "SourceType": "original-20261114",
        "PreviewText": "B\u00E0i h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn b\u1ED1 tr\u00ED b\u00E0n h\u1ECDc b\u1EB1ng \u0111\u1ED3 c\u00F3 s\u1EB5n.",
        "IsPublished": true
      },
      "references": {}
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.desk-light.23b6f36f59d14bfc89f80c9ffaafc760",
      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "VietnameseText": "\u0110\u1EB7t s\u00E1ch v\u00E0 v\u1EDF trong t\u1EA7m tay \u0111\u1EC3 d\u1EC5 l\u1EA5y.",
        "EnglishMeaning": "Keep books and notebooks within reach so they are easy to get.",
        "BreakAfter": false
      },
      "references": {
        "WritingExerciseId": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.desk-light"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.desk-light.47d80f276ddf4e859755dde5b6f3b7c2",
      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "VietnameseText": "Tr\u01B0\u1EDBc h\u1EBFt, c\u1EA5t nh\u1EEFng th\u1EE9 kh\u00F4ng d\u00F9ng \u0111\u1EBFn v\u00E0o m\u1ED9t chi\u1EBFc h\u1ED9p.",
        "EnglishMeaning": "First, put things you do not need into a box.",
        "BreakAfter": false
      },
      "references": {
        "WritingExerciseId": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.desk-light"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.desk-light.48ff50f94bf64802b0b0f4a9dd39efc5",
      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 7,
        "VietnameseText": "Cu\u1ED1i m\u1ED7i bu\u1ED5i h\u1ECDc, d\u00E0nh hai ph\u00FAt x\u1EBFp l\u1EA1i b\u00E0n.",
        "EnglishMeaning": "At the end of each study session, spend two minutes tidying the table.",
        "BreakAfter": false
      },
      "references": {
        "WritingExerciseId": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.desk-light"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.desk-light.4f64976b7bb2448bbd885ed119a4505a",
      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "VietnameseText": "B\u1EA1n c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 t\u1EA1o g\u00F3c h\u1ECDc t\u1EADp ngay tr\u00EAn m\u1ED9t chi\u1EBFc b\u00E0n nh\u1ECF.",
        "EnglishMeaning": "You can make a study corner on a small table.",
        "BreakAfter": false
      },
      "references": {
        "WritingExerciseId": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.desk-light"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.desk-light.52079c65c0874541a61b6f7f9dd963e3",
      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "VietnameseText": "N\u1EBFu c\u00F3 th\u1EC3, h\u00E3y ch\u1ECDn m\u1ED9t ch\u1ED7 c\u00F3 \u0111\u1EE7 \u00E1nh s\u00E1ng t\u1EF1 nhi\u00EAn.",
        "EnglishMeaning": "If possible, choose a place with enough natural light.",
        "BreakAfter": true
      },
      "references": {
        "WritingExerciseId": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.desk-light"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.desk-light.80b0fcbc8ecc408a81e8996649788928",
      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 8,
        "VietnameseText": "M\u1ED9t g\u00F3c g\u1ECDn g\u00E0ng gi\u00FAp b\u1EA1n b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u bu\u1ED5i h\u1ECDc ti\u1EBFp theo d\u1EC5 h\u01A1n.",
        "EnglishMeaning": "A tidy corner makes the next study session easier to start.",
        "BreakAfter": true
      },
      "references": {
        "WritingExerciseId": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.desk-light"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.desk-light.bddc867a11bd46578b24c61734188c35",
      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "VietnameseText": "V\u00E0o bu\u1ED5i t\u1ED1i, d\u00F9ng \u0111\u00E8n ph\u00F9 h\u1EE3p v\u1EDBi kh\u00F4ng gian h\u1ECDc.",
        "EnglishMeaning": "In the evening, use a lamp that suits your study space.",
        "BreakAfter": false
      },
      "references": {
        "WritingExerciseId": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.desk-light"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.desk-light.c00c5ed9248c4d5584da9d3d904dc3e6",
      "kind": "WritingAcceptedAnswer",
      "values": {
        "AnswerText": "First, put anything you do not need in a box.",
